OL,3,GNEWSABird strike forces flight to land
OL,4,Aat East Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger aircraft that had just
OL,7,Ftaken off for a three-hour flight had
OL,8,Fto be diverted after a bird strike.
OL,10,FThe Ryanair flight from Norwich to
OL,11,FMalta departed at 08:41 BST on Tuesday
OL,12,Fbefore it was seen adopting a holding
OL,13,Fpattern over the city at about 7,000 ft
OL,14,F(2,134m) - and then the same over
OL,15,FNottingham.
OL,17,FIn a statement, a Ryanair spokesperson
OL,18,Fsaid: "This flight from Norwich to
OL,19,FMalta diverted to East Midlands Airport
OL,20,Ffollowing a minor bird strike shortly
OL,21,Fafter take-off.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
